      "createdAt": "2026-07-23T07:34:56.000Z",
      "text": "I'm a bit skeptical about this narrative around an OpenAI model escaping to go hack HuggingFace servers.\n\n➡ In 2008 I was running a chatbot company. We almost rolled out a marketing stunt: pretending our agents had escaped, reached out to people on the outside, and seduced them.",
